| `wave<k>-<cat>.pages.json` | generated batch manifest (pages + item lists, from disk) |
| `wave<k>-<cat>.provenance.jsonl` | Beta's **provenance evidence ledger**: one row per item, `{id, statement, proof, evidence, urls[], rationale, at}` |
